  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Costa Rica: Integration of Migrants through Regularization and Access to Employment in Costa Rica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to strengthen Costa Rica&#x2019;s Government&#x2019;s capacities to integrate migrants through regularization and access to employment, enhanced by bilateral and binational cooperation, public-private partnerships, as well as the strengthening of labor migration governance and awareness. IOM proposes to support the Government in extending and broadening the scope of initiatives highlighted above that have proven to be very successful, to make them sustainable over time and expand their target sectors and territories.  Additionally, the project aims to strengthen access to and communication on migration regularization programs at the national level advocate for legal reforms and decrees that will strengthen labor migration governance.</narrative>
  </description>
